{"text": "Interestingly, if you are sad, then listening to sad music can sometimes improve your mood. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You might suppose that the last thing that would help, if you are having a bad day, is to play something that reflects that negativity. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Why would not a sad person listen to happy music. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The reason is that when you are feeling down or depressed, it is often because you feel misunderstood that the people around you do not appreciate what you are going through. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If you were to listen to happy music while in this state, it would only amplify that feeling of detachment. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On the other hand, if you put on the right piece of sad music, you can say to yourself, That is exactly how I feel, This musician understands me. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So the sad music turns out to be soothing a companion to your misery, as it were.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "n", "t", "e", "r", "e", "s", "t", "i", "n", "g", "l", "y", ",", " ", "i", "f", " ", "y", "o", "u", " ", "a", "r", "e", " ", "s", "a", "d", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", "n", " ", "l", "i", "s", "t", "e", "n", "i", "n", "g", " ", "t", "o", " ", "s", "a", "d", " ", "m", "u", "s", "i", "c", " ", "c", "a", "n", " ", "s", "o", "m", "e", "t", "i", "m", "e", "s", " ", "i", "m", "p", "r", "o", "v", "e", " ", "y", "o", "u", "r", " ", "m", "o", "o", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "Y", "o", "u", " ", "m", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "s", "u", "p", "p", "o", "s", "e", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "l", "a", "s", "t", " ", "t", "h", "i", "n", "g", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "w", "o", "u", "l", "d", " ", "h", "e", "l", "p", ",", " ", "i", "f", " ", "y", "o", "u", " ", "a", "r", "e", " ", "h", "a", "v", "i", "n", "g", " ", "a", " ", "b", "a", "d", " ", "d", "a", "y", ",", " ", "i", "s", " ", "t", "o", " ", "p",